  "plain": "A documentary filmmaker, James Fox, revisits a 1996 case in the Brazilian town of Varginha, where people say a strange living creature was captured after a crash, in his film Moment of Contact. Fox says he gathered new testimony from two forensic pathologists, the local police chief, a new crash witness, and Italo Venturelli, the lead neurosurgeon at the regional hospital. If their accounts hold, it would mean a non-human being was taken into custody."
